+    // The caller's orientation and animation gating both read parsed metadata.
+    // Until headers are in, orientation() reports None for what may turn out to
+    // be a rotated image, which would bake a wrongly-mapped raster into the cache.
+    // A non-empty size() means the header pass (which also yields the
+    // orientation) has completed.
+    if (size().isEmpty())
+        return false;
